"It’s too late to carry on counting: adding to it now would mix two different "
"times."
msgstr ""
"Il est trop tard pour continuer : y ajouter maintenant mélangerait deux "
"moments différents."

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/counts/stale.html:41
