"This report is being checked. It isn't on the map or in the list for now."
msgstr ""
"Ce signalement est en cours de vérification. Il n'est plus sur la carte ni "
"dans la liste pour le moment."

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/moderation/state_notes.html:46
