"Please add your photos again: we can't keep them when something needs fixing."
msgstr ""
"Merci de rajouter vos photos : nous ne pouvons pas les garder quand quelque "
"chose est à corriger."

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:74
msgid ""
"Something that helps you get around, or something in the way: both are "
"useful."
msgstr ""
"Quelque chose qui vous aide à vous déplacer, ou quelque chose qui gêne : les "
"deux sont utiles."

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:78
msgid "1. Where is it?"
msgstr "1. Où est-ce ?"

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:79
#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:87
#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:106
msgid "(required)"
msgstr "(obligatoire)"

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:86
msgid "2. Are you reporting this as a pedestrian or a cyclist?"
msgstr "2. Vous faites ce signalement en tant que piéton ou cycliste ?"

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:105
msgid "3. Photos"
msgstr "3. Photos"

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:109
#, python-format
msgid ""
"At least one, up to %(n)s, each up to %(mb)s MB. Ideally one wide shot so "
"people recognise the place, and one close-up of the detail. Avoid faces and "
"number plates if you can."
msgstr ""
"Au moins une, jusqu'à %(n)s, de %(mb)s Mo maximum chacune. Idéalement une "
"vue d'ensemble pour qu'on reconnaisse l'endroit, et un gros plan sur le "
"détail. Évitez si possible les visages et les plaques d'immatriculation."

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:116
