msgstr "Rajoutez vos photos ici."

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:122
msgid "Add photos"
msgstr "Ajouter des photos"

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:131
msgid "4. What's here?"
msgstr "4. Qu'y a-t-il ici ?"

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:132
#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:143
msgid "(optional)"
msgstr "(facultatif)"

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:136
msgid "What helps or gets in the way, and for whom. It helps a lot."
msgstr "Ce qui aide ou ce qui gêne, et pour qui. Cela aide beaucoup."

#: mobilito_app/templates/mobilito_app/reports/new.html:142
msgid "5. What kind of thing is it?"
msgstr "5. De quoi s'agit-il ?"

